Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: retain PON DMA ownership through TX reclamation

Keep an internal attachment reference for each mapped TX descriptor and
release it on completion, rollback or cleanup. Disconnect callbacks before
waiting for the descriptor count without RTNL, bound the wait, and reject
reattachment while old TX buffers remain. A timeout never resets shared DMA
or claims that the optical/FE pipeline is idle.

